<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Boxwise: learn the CSS box model</title>
<style>
*,*::before,*::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; scroll-padding-top: 72px; }

:root {
  --teal: #0f766e;
  --teal-dark: #115e59;
  --teal-light: #ccfbf1;
  --ink: #1f2937;
  --orange: #c2410c;
  --orange-light: #ffedd5;
  --z-header: 100;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  background: #f4f4f0;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

/* Shared */
.section { padding: 56px 24px; }
.section__title { margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 1.6rem; text-align: center; }
.button {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 10px 20px;
  border: 2px solid var(--teal);
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: var(--teal);
  color: #fff;
  font: inherit;
  font-weight: 600;
  text-decoration: none;
  cursor: pointer;
}
.button:hover { background: var(--teal-dark); }
.button--ghost { background: #fff; color: var(--teal); }
.button--ghost:hover { background: var(--teal); color: #fff; }
.button:focus-visible,
.navbar a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--orange); outline-offset: 3px; }

/* Navbar */
.navbar {
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: var(--z-header);
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 16px;
  padding: 12px 24px;
  background: var(--ink);
  border-bottom: 3px solid var(--teal);
}
.navbar__logo { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; }
.navbar__menu { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px; }
.navbar__links { display: flex; gap: 20px; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
.navbar__link {
  padding: 6px 2px;
  color: #d1d5db;
  text-decoration: none;
  border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
}
.navbar__link:hover { color: #fff; border-bottom-color: #14b8a6; }

/* Hero banner */
.hero {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 16px;
  min-height: 460px;
  padding: 48px 24px;
  background: var(--teal-light);
  border-bottom: 3px solid var(--teal);
  text-align: center;
}
.hero__title {
  max-width: 18ch;
  margin: 0;
  font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.4rem);
  line-height: 1.1;
  color: var(--teal);
}
.hero__text { max-width: 50ch; margin: 0; font-size: 1.1rem; }
.hero__actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; margin-top: 8px; }

/* Rows of cards */
.card-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; }
.card {
  --accent: var(--teal);
  --tint: #fff;
  flex: 1 1 200px;
  padding: 20px;
  border: 3px solid var(--accent);
  border-radius: 16px;
  background: var(--tint);
  text-align: center;
}
.card--orange { --accent: var(--orange); --tint: var(--orange-light); }
.card--teal { --tint: var(--teal-light); }
.card__avatar {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: 72px;
  height: 72px;
  margin: 0 auto 12px;
  border: 4px solid var(--accent);
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #fff;
  color: var(--accent);
  font-size: 1.3rem;
  font-weight: 700;
}
.card__title { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--accent); }
.card__text { margin: 0; font-size: .92rem; }

/* Call to action + footer */
.cta {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  background: var(--ink);
  color: #fff;
  text-align: center;
}
.cta__title { margin: 0; font-size: 1.6rem; }
.cta__text { margin: 0 0 8px; color: #d1d5db; }
.footer {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 8px;
  padding: 16px 24px;
  background: #111827;
  color: #9ca3af;
  font-size: .85rem;
}

@media (max-width: 600px) { .navbar__links { display: none; } }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { html { scroll-behavior: auto; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="navbar">
  <a class="navbar__logo" href="#top">Boxwise</a>
  <nav class="navbar__menu" aria-label="Main">
    <ul class="navbar__links">
      <li><a class="navbar__link" href="#features">Features</a></li>
      <li><a class="navbar__link" href="#team">Team</a></li>
      <li><a class="navbar__link" href="#join">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
    <a class="button" href="#join">Sign up</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<section class="hero" id="top">
  <h1 class="hero__title">See every pixel of the box model</h1>
  <p class="hero__text">Padding, border and margin, explained with live examples you can drag, resize and break on purpose.</p>
  <div class="hero__actions">
    <a class="button" href="#join">Start free</a>
    <a class="button button--ghost" href="#features">See how it works</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="features">
  <h2 class="section__title">What you get</h2>
  <div class="card-row">
    <article class="card card--teal">
      <h3 class="card__title">Live diagram</h3>
      <p class="card__text">Change a value and watch margin, border and padding move.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card card--orange">
      <h3 class="card__title">border-box vs content-box</h3>
      <p class="card__text">Switch between both and see why widths change.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card card--teal">
      <h3 class="card__title">Copy-ready CSS</h3>
      <p class="card__text">Every experiment gives you clean code to paste.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="team">
  <h2 class="section__title">Who makes it</h2>
  <div class="card-row">
    <article class="card card--teal">
      <div class="card__avatar" aria-hidden="true">AS</div>
      <h3 class="card__title">Aarav Sharma</h3>
      <p class="card__text">Frontend developer</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card card--orange">
      <div class="card__avatar" aria-hidden="true">PV</div>
      <h3 class="card__title">Priya Verma</h3>
      <p class="card__text">UI designer</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card card--teal">
      <div class="card__avatar" aria-hidden="true">RG</div>
      <h3 class="card__title">Rohan Gupta</h3>
      <p class="card__text">Backend developer</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card card--orange">
      <div class="card__avatar" aria-hidden="true">NS</div>
      <h3 class="card__title">Neha Singh</h3>
      <p class="card__text">Product manager</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section cta" id="join">
  <h2 class="cta__title">Ready to stop guessing at spacing?</h2>
  <p class="cta__text">Create a free account and start experimenting.</p>
  <a class="button" href="#top">Sign up</a>
</section>

<footer class="footer">
  <span>© 2026 Boxwise</span>
  <span>Built with HTML and CSS only</span>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
